  "2948": {
    "solution": [
      {
        "msg": "### a) $Re(\\lang u,v \\rang)=\\frac{1}{4}(||u+v||^2-||u-v||^2)$\nZ tvrzení 8.32 víme, že   \n$Re(\\lang u,v \\rang)=\\frac{1}{2}(||u+v||^2-||u||^2-||v||^2)$   \n$\\frac{1}{2}(||u+v||^2-||u||^2-||v||^2) = \\frac{1}{4}(2||u+v||^2-2||u||^2-2||v||^2) =$   \n$=\\frac{1}{4}(2||u+v||^2-(2||u||^2+2||v||^2))$   \nTo se díky Tvrzení 8.31 (3) rovná   \n$\\frac{1}{4}(2||u+v||^2-(||u+v||^2+||u-v||^2)) = \\frac{1}{4}(||u+v||^2-||u-v||^2)$   \n   \n### b) $Im(\\lang u,v \\rang)=\\frac{1}{4}(||u-iv||^2-||u+iv||^2)$\nZ tvrzení 8.32    \n$Im(\\lang u,v \\rang)=\\frac{1}{2}(||u-iv||^2-||u||^2-||v||^2)$    \n$\\frac{1}{2}(||u-iv||^2-||u||^2-||v||^2) = \\frac{1}{2}(\\lang u-iv,u-iv\\rang -\\lang u,u\\rang -\\lang v,v\\rang) =$   \n$=\\frac{1}{2}(\\lang u,u\\rang - \\lang u,iv\\rang - \\lang iv,u\\rang + \\lang iv,iv\\rang-\\lang u,u\\rang - \\lang v,v\\rang)=-\\frac{1}{2}(\\lang u,iv\\rang + \\lang iv,u\\rang)=$   \n$=\\frac{1}{4}(-2(\\lang u,iv\\rang + \\lang iv,u\\rang)=\\frac{1}{4}(-\\lang u,iv\\rang -\\lang iv,u\\rang - (\\lang u,iv\\rang + \\lang iv,u\\rang))=$   \n$=\\frac{1}{4}(\\lang u,u \\rang-\\lang u,iv\\rang -\\lang iv,u\\rang + \\lang iv,iv\\rang-(\\lang u,u\\rang+\\lang u,iv\\rang+\\lang iv,u\\rang+\\lang iv,iv\\rang))=$   \n$=\\frac{1}{4}(\\lang u-iv, u-iv\\rang-\\lang u+iv,u+iv\\rang)=\\frac{1}{4}(||u-iv||^2-||u+iv||^2)$"
      }
    ]
  },
