  "3167": {
    "solution": [
      {
        "msg": "$\\gdef\\bf#1{\\mathbf{#1}}$\n$\\gdef\\u{\\bf{u}}$\n$\\gdef\\v{\\bf{v}}$\n$\\gdef\\scal#1#2{\\langle #1, #2 \\rangle}$\n$\\gdef\\sscal#1{\\scal{#1}{#1}}$\nUpravme vzorec ze zadání s využitím linearity skalárního součinu a identity $\\overline{\\scal{\\u}{\\v}} = \\scal{\\v}{\\u}$.\n$$ \\frac{1}{4}(\\|\\u+\\v\\|^2 - \\|\\u-\\v \\|^2) = \\frac{1}{4} (\\sscal{\\u+\\v} - \\sscal{\\u-\\v}) = $$\n$$ = \\frac{1}{4}(\\sscal{\\u} + \\scal{\\u}{\\v} + \\scal{\\v}{\\u} + \\sscal{\\v} - \\sscal{\\u}+\\scal{\\u}{\\v}+\\scal{\\v}{\\u}-\\sscal{\\v}) = $$\n$$ = \\frac{1}{2} (\\scal{\\u}{\\v} + \\scal{\\v}{\\u}) = \\frac{1}{2}(\\scal{\\u}{\\v}+\\overline{\\scal{\\u}{\\v}}) = \\frac{1}{2}(2 ~\\text{Re} (\\scal{\\u}{\\v})) = \\text{Re}~(\\scal{\\u}{\\v}) $$\nObdobně pro druhou rovnost.\n$$ \\frac{1}{4}(\\|\\u-i\\v\\|^2-\\|\\u+i\\v\\|^2) = \\frac{1}{4}(\\sscal{\\u-i\\v} - \\sscal{\\u+i\\v}) = $$\n$$ = \\frac{1}{4}(\\sscal{\\u}-\\sscal{\\v}-\\scal{i\\v}{\\u}-\\scal{\\u}{i\\v}-\\sscal{\\u}+\\sscal{\\v}-\\scal{\\u}{i\\v}-\\scal{i\\v}{\\u}) = $$\n$$ = \\frac{1}{2}(-\\scal{\\u}{i\\v}-\\scal{i\\v}{\\u}) = \\frac{1}{2}(-i\\scal{\\u}{\\v}+i\\scal{\\v}{\\u}) = \\frac{1}{2i}(\\scal{\\u}{\\v}-\\overline{\\scal{\\u}{\\v}}) = \\text{Im}~(\\scal{\\u}{\\v}) $$\nTím oba vzorce platí pro libovolný komplexní vektorový prostor s definovaným skalárním součinem (a odvozenou metrikou). $\\hearts$"
      }
    ]
  },
